+# Koromali Update Pack
+
+This update adds:
+- **Safe Mode** (`KOROMALI_SAFE_MODE=1`): skips user plugin directory; loads built-ins and core tools.
+- **No Plugins** (`KOROMALI_NO_PLUGINS=1`): skips plugin discovery entirely.
+- **Plugin quarantine**: after 3 consecutive load failures a plugin is auto-disabled (state persisted). Nothing is deleted.
+- Restored missing modules/shims; AI Studio patch parsing; style presets persistence; robust logger/helpers; theme validator.
+
+## Windows One-Click
+Double-click `run_windows.bat` (creates venv, installs requirements, launches).
+
+## Recovery tips
+If the app crashed recently due to a plugin, you can start with:
+```
+set KOROMALI_SAFE_MODE=1
+run_windows.bat
+```
+Then open Preferences → Plugins and re-enable intentionally.
